rationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Operation Guns DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Prism_Damsel.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"arcana:gemini-i"}," ",{"t":"Prism Damsel","r":"arcana:gemini-i"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OperationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Operation Guns DLC to access"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Icebrand.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:icebrand"}," ",{"t":"Icebrand","r":"weapon:icebrand"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," are already able to freeze enemies and instead gain a greatly increased chance to freeze enemies."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["With ",{"i":"Sprite-Out_of_Bounds_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," ",{"t":"Out of Bounds (XII)","r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"},", inflicting freeze onto an enemy will also create an explosion dealing damage to them and other nearby enemies."]},{"c":["With ",{"i":"Sprite-Crystal_Cries_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"}," ",{"t":"Crystal Cries (XII)","r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"},", defeating frozen enemies will drop ",{"i":"Sprite-Crystallized_Soul.png","w":24,"h":23}," Crystallized Souls that grant ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," when collected."]},{"c":["The freeze from the listed weapons cannot freeze ",{"i":"Sprite-The_Reaper.png","w":20,"h":24}," The Reaper."]},{"c":["With +300% ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", the listed weapons are guaranteed to freeze enemies. This is possible by playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Exdash_Exiviiq.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:exdash-exiviiq"}," ",{"t":"Exdash Exiviiq","r":"character:exdash-exiviiq"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Toastie.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:toastie"}," ",{"t":"Toastie","r":"character:toastie"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-Smith_IV.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:smith-iv"}," ",{"t":"Smith IV","r":"character:smith-iv"},", the ",{"i":"Sprite-Clover.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:clover"}," ",{"t":"Clover","r":"passive:clover"},", and a few ",{"i":"Sprite-Little_Clover.png","w":24,"h":24}," Little Clovers. ",{"i":"Sprite-Keitha_Muort.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:keitha-muort"}," ",{"t":"Keitha Muort","r":"character:keitha-muort"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-TidesOfTheFoscari.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Cosmo_Pavone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:cosmo-pavone"}," ",{"t":"Cosmo Pavone","r":"character:cosmo-pavone"}," can reach +300% Luck through leveling. ",{"i":"Sprite-Wicked_Season_(XIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," ",{"t":"Wicked Season (XIII)","r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," can also be used to reach +300% Luck."]},{"c":["Pairing up with ",{"i":"Sprite-Garlic.png","w":17,"h":17,"r":"weapon:garlic"}," ",{"t":"Garlic","r":"weapon:garlic"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Soul_Eater.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:soul-eater"}," ",{"t":"Soul Eater","r":"weapon:soul-eater"}," can make some enemies that are normally immune susceptible to freeze."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 20 October 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Bracelet is now affected by arcana XIV - Jail of Crystal. Bi-Bracelet is also affected by Arcana II - Twilight Requiem. Tri-Bracelet is also affected by Arcana XIX - Heart of Fire"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 23 May 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The name of this Arcana is a reference to the song \"",{"t":"Jail of Jewel","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Jail_of_Jewel"},"\", which is the theme song of the ",{"t":"Great Stairway","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Great_Stairway"}," in ",{"t":"Castlevania: Portrait of Ruin","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Castlevania:_Portrait_of_Ruin"},"."]},{"c":["Jail of Crystal (XIV) can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"latemperanza\", which means \"temperance\" in Italian."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["This makes Jail of Crystal (XIV) a representation of the ",{"t":"Temperance","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temperance_(tarot_card)"}," Major Arcana card, symbolizing patience, moderation, frugality, balance, tranquility, humility, and higher learning."]},{"c":["This is reflected in its ability to provide water, ice, and many other blue-colored weapons the power to freeze enemies."]}]}},{"c":["There was a bug where Jail of Crystal (XIV) does not affect the ",{"i":"Sprite-Dragon_Water_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:dragon-water-whip"}," ",{"t":"Dragon Water Whip","r":"weapon:dragon-water-whip"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," or the ",{"i":"Sprite-Hydrostormer_Tip.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hydrostormer-tip"}," ",{"t":"Hydrostormer Tip","r":"weapon:hydrostormer-tip"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},". It has since been fixed."]},{"c":["Despite being closely related to the freeze mechanic and the evolved form even has an innate chance to freeze enemies, both ",{"i":"Sprite-Glass_Fandango.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:glass-fandango"}," ",{"t":"Glass Fandango","r":"weapon:glass-fandango"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Celestial_Voulge.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"}," ",{"t":"Celestial Voulge","r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"}," does not benefit from it."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}